LICENCE RESTRICTIONS
You must:
not use the App or any Service in any unlawful manner, for any unlawful purpose, or in any manner inconsistent with these Terms and Conditions, or act fraudulently or maliciously, for example, by hacking into or inserting malicious programs or code, including viruses, or harmful data, into the App, any Service or any operating system;
