Conduct of Field Collection
Field collection activities shall be conducted in a professional, respectful, and non-coercive manner, in compliance with the Digital Credit Providers Regulations, 2022 and the Consumer Protection Act, 2012, which prohibits unfair, deceptive, or abusive practices in debt collection.
Aventus or its authorized agents shall:
